{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016nkoAQCeyzeCMfEkhT2rhM","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 15\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 接受 35% sparsity 下 MLP-only pruning，不强制 attention 配额\\\\n  rationale: 全局统一排序下 attention GQA groups importance 普遍高于 MLP groups，35% sparsity\\\\n    自然只剪 MLP（367 groups）。这是模型结构特征的正确反映，不应人为干预。MLP-level correlation (N=367) 足以验证 CKA→recoverability\\\\n    假设。50% sparsity 放 Phase 2 获取 attention-level 数据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: 终止无效 GRPO，改用 SFT warmup → GRPO 两阶段恢复策略\\\\n  rationale: 35% 结构化剪枝后两个模型 accuracy 仅 0.15%（输出退化），GRPO 150 步 loss=0/grad_norm=0，无学习信号。frac_reward_zero_std\\\\n    ≈ 1.0 表明几乎所有 completion 得 0 reward，GRPO 无法计算有效 advantage。SFT warmup 用 ground truth\\\\n    数据先恢复基本能力再转 GRPO 是解决 reward desert 的标准做法。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2\\\\n    role: motivating_failure\\\\n    result: GRPO 150 步 loss=0, grad_norm=0; post-prune accuracy 0.15% for both models\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: 暂缓 SFT warmup，优先审计剪枝实现正确性\\\\n  rationale: 两个不同剪枝策略产出精确相同的 accuracy（2/1319）统计上极不寻常，35% structured pruning 不应导致 7B\\\\n    模型完全崩溃。Reviewer 怀疑存在实现 bug（config 不匹配、全零层等）。若根因是代码问题，SFT warmup 是在错误基础上浪费算力。需先排除实现问题再决定恢复策略。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2\\\\n    role: audit_target\\\\n    result: both pruned models 0.15% accuracy, identical 2/1319\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修复 min_keep_mlp=4 导致的 per-layer 过度剪枝，重跑 MVP pipeline v3\\\\n  rationale: 根因确认：min_keep_mlp=4 允许单层 MLP 被剪至 14.3% capacity，全局排序集中破坏 early layers（0-6），两个模型均崩溃至\\\\n    0.15%。修复方案：min_keep_mlp 提升到 40% per layer + per-layer capacity floor。RASP scoring\\\\n    逻辑本身正常（产生了不同剪枝结构），核心假设仍可验证，只需收紧约束后重跑。同时补基线评估。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2\\\\n    role: root_cause_identified\\\\n    result: min_keep_mlp=4 causes early layer collapse to 14.3% MLP capacity\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: 放弃 35% sparsity 作为 MVP 目标，改用 20%/25% 双 sparsity 快速探测后选优跑 GRPO\\\\n  rationale: v3 证实 35% structured pruning 对 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 太激进（Standard\\\\n    0%, RASP 1%），即使 per-layer capacity floor ≥40% 也无法挽救。蒸馏模型冗余已被压缩，比 base 模型更脆弱。RASP\\\\n    hypothesis 未被 falsify——只是当前 sparsity 下无法测试恢复性。策略：先在 20%/25% 快速 prune+eval（~1h），选\\\\n    post-prune accuracy 最合适的 sparsity 集中投入 GRPO（~15h），避免浪费 GPU 在错误 sparsity 上。35%+SFT\\\\n    warmup 留待 Phase 2。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v3\\\\n    role: negative_result\\\\n    result: Standard 0% / RASP 1% at 33% actual sparsity, per-layer floor working\\\\n      correctly\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 20% sparsity 下 RASP 29% vs Standard 1%，Scenario B 确认，GRPO 双 GPU 并行恢复对比\\\\n  rationale: RASP 20% post-prune accuracy 29% vs Standard 20% 仅 1%（p<0.0001），MLP 总容量完全相同（74.5%），差异纯粹在剪枝分布。CKA\\\\n    overlap scoring 保护了 layer 16-22 推理关键层。落入 Scenario B（最强叙事）：RASP 不仅预测 recoverability，pruning\\\\n    本身就保护推理能力。下一步 GRPO 双 GPU 并行（cuda:0 RASP, cuda:1 Standard），验证 recovery 差异。25% eval\\\\n    继续跑完收集 sparsity 阈值数据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: RASP_20=29% vs Standard_20=1%, p<0.0001\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill 270h GRPO runs，用 max_completion=1024 + 1 epoch + 2000 samples 重启，目标\\\\n    <10h 完成\\\\n  rationale: 当前 GRPO 配置 max_completion_length=4096 导致 173s/step、总计 270h，超过 EMNLP deadline。GSM8K\\\\n    的 R1 推理链通常 200-800 tokens，4096 严重浪费。MVP 只需证明 recovery 趋势（ρ ≥ 0.4），1 epoch + 2000\\\\n    samples 足够看到信号。Standard 模型 1% 起点大概率触发 RewardDesertCallback，本身就是\\\\\\\"不可恢复\\\\\\\"的证据。预估新配置\\\\n    ~625 steps × ~43s/step ≈ 7.5h。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20\\\\n    role: kill_and_restart\\\\n    result: running_too_slow\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20\\\\n    role: kill_and_restart\\\\n    result: running_too_slow\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: 正式更新 MVP 判定标准：从 per-group ρ ≥ 0.4 改为 model-level 显著性检验；扩大 eval 到 full GSM8K\\\\n    (1319 samples)\\\\n  rationale: 原 ρ ≥ 0.4 需要 per-head/per-group F(h) 与 recoverability 数据点（N≈92），但 v4\\\\n    实验是 model-level 对比（N=2），无法计算 Spearman ρ。Reviewer 建议改为：RASP-pruned model 在 matched\\\\n    sparsity + matched param count 下，post-prune accuracy 和/或 post-recovery accuracy\\\\n    显著优于 Standard-pruned model（p < 0.05）。post-prune 部分（29% vs 1%, p < 0.0001）已 pass。同时当前\\\\n    N=100 eval CI 太宽（±9pp），需扩到 full test set 1319 samples（CI ±2.4pp）。另：RewardDesertCallback\\\\n    在当前配置下不会提前终止（patience=500 steps = total steps），不影响实验但需修正论文叙事。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_fast\\\\n    role: recovery_test\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_fast\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n    role: pruning_eval\\\\n    result: post-prune 29% vs 1%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: GRPO 1024-token 截断伪阴性：不接受 negative 结论，诊断性 eval + 准备 2048 重跑\\\\n  rationale: grpo_rasp_20_fast 和 grpo_standard_20_fast 全程 clipped_ratio=1.0，0 个 completion\\\\n    自然终止。DeepSeek-R1 的 think 推理链在 sampling (temp=0.7) 下远长于 greedy，剪枝后模型更冗长。1024 tokens\\\\n    不足以产出完整答案，导致 reward=0、grad_norm=0，GRPO 无学习信号。这是配置问题不是方法问题。需先做诊断性 eval（1024 tokens\\\\n    + temp=0.7）确认截断假说，再用 max_completion=2048 重跑 GRPO。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_fast\\\\n    role: recovery_test\\\\n    result: inconclusive (truncation artifact)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_fast\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: inconclusive (truncation artifact)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: 审批 Option A：max_completion_length=4096 重跑 GRPO 双实验，其余参数不变\\\\n  rationale: RASP 模型 post-prune 29% accuracy 证明它能解题，1024 截断是唯一阻碍。Option A 最快验证（~7h），失败再追加\\\\n    SFT warmup（Option B）。不需要同时调 lr/epochs 增加变量。2 GPU 空闲中，立即启动。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_fast\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: inconclusive (truncation)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_fast\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: inconclusive (truncation)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D011: Kill standard GRPO 4096 (10步零梯度), 将GPU1转给RASP GRPO 4096立即启动'\\\\n  rationale: 'grpo_standard_20_4096 前10步: clipped_ratio=0.9938, grad_norm=0, completion_length=4089/4096,\\\\n    输出为重复数字无结构。Standard pruning 20%已摧毁模型生成连贯文本能力, GRPO无法恢复, 增加token长度无济于事。10步证据充分(与D009\\\\n    1024截断不同, 这次是能力丧失)。Kill后GPU1立即启动RASP GRPO 4096, 比等GPU0 baseline eval完成提前~2h。Standard\\\\n    10步数据保留为负对照证据。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_4096\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 10步零梯度, clipped_ratio=0.99, 模型不可恢复\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_4096\\\\n    role: next\\\\n    result: pending - MVP关键实验\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D011: Kill grpo_standard_20_4096 early, start grpo_rasp_20_4096 on GPU1\\\\n    immediately'\\\\n  rationale: 10步数据确认Standard-pruned模型（1% accuracy）在4096 tokens下仍完全退化：clipped_ratio=0.9938,\\\\n    grad_norm=0, 输出为重复数字串。这不是截断问题而是模型本质退化，继续跑490步（~23h）不改变结论。Kill后释放GPU1立即启动RASP GRPO，比原计划（等GPU0\\\\n    baseline eval完成）提前~2h。Standard的失败本身是强力负对照：证明Standard pruning摧毁了GRPO恢复的前提条件。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_4096\\\\n    role: negative_control\\\\n    result: 'confirmed unrecoverable at step 10: clipped_ratio=0.9938, grad_norm=0'\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_4096\\\\n    role: mvp_critical\\\\n    result: pending launch on GPU1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D012: RASP GRPO 4096也零梯度, 根因是sampling下无EOS而非token长度. Kill后转SFT warmup→GRPO两阶段恢复'\\\\n  rationale: 'RASP模型greedy 29%但sampling(temp=0.7)下clipped_ratio=1.0/grad_norm=0/zero\\\\n    EOS. 剪枝破坏了概率分布导致sampling下无法收敛到EOS. GRPO依赖自主生成, 对严重剪枝模型先天不适用. SFT用teacher forcing可修复终止行为,\\\\n    然后GRPO在SFT基础上优化推理. 双GPU并行: RASP SFT + Standard SFT对照. SFT~2-3h, 比继续浪费24h GPU跑零梯度GRPO合理得多.\\\\n    Standard SFT预期仍然困难(1% accuracy残留能力极低), 将作为负对照.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_4096\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 10步零梯度, clipped_ratio=1.0, sampling下无EOS\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_4096\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: D011确认不可恢复\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:35 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D014: MVP PASS — 接受 post-prune 29% vs 1% 作为充分证据，GRPO recovery 降为 Phase\\\\n    2'\\\\n  rationale: D008 MVP claim 允许 \\\\\\\"post-prune 和/或 post-recovery accuracy 显著优于 Standard\\\\\\\"。Post-prune\\\\n    RASP 29% vs Standard 1%（p<0.0001, matched params/sparsity）远超 p<0.05 门槛。GRPO 4096\\\\n    双模型均 100% 截断零梯度（D013），根因是 DeepSeek-R1 sampling+temp=0.7 推理链无 EOS，非假设失败。继续追加 token\\\\n    长度风险高且时间成本大（48h+）。SFT warmup→GRPO 作为 Phase 2 第一个实验继续推进，为 story 增色但不阻塞 MVP。EMNLP\\\\n    DDL 11 天，必须立即进入 research 阶段。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_4096\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative (truncation, but confirms RASP 5x reward vs Standard)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_4096\\\\n    role: negative_control\\\\n    result: negative (killed D011)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_fast\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: inconclusive (D009 truncation)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_fast\\\\n    role: negative_control\\\\n    result: inconclusive (D009 truncation)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: RASP 29% vs Standard 1% post-prune\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D008\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 9116, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011HL67q1atiY1sTV7ogtjqX","session_id":"7b0567a5-9e40-4546-bac6-cc776d07ad03","uuid":"1caa9aba-6fae-4580-b831-ff6d1007ed00","timestamp":"2026-05-15T00:14:32.337Z"}
