{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RjDXsWmea669G2ogCkzfEv","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# recovery_aware_struct_prune — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 23:40 UTC | 更新原因: MVP PASS (D014) → Research Phase 启动，post-MVP kickoff 写完 framing + plan + dream launched\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nRecovery-Aware Structured Pruning (RASP)：CKA functional overlap 指导结构化剪枝，在 matched sparsity 下比 importance-only 剪枝显著更好地保留推理能力（**Redundancy Paradox** — 传统冗余信号是 RLVR 可恢复性的正预测因子）。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\nEMNLP 2026 ARR May 25 提交（距今 11 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research Phase** — MVP 已通过（D014），正在执行 post-MVP kickoff 流程。\\\\n\\\\n## 核心证据\\\\n- Post-prune GSM8K (N=100): RASP 29% vs Standard 1% (p<0.0001, matched 20% sparsity)\\\\n- GRPO 直接恢复失败（D009/D013: sampling 无 EOS 导致截断），转 SFT warmup → GRPO 两阶段\\\\n- RASP 在截断 GRPO 中仍有 5× reward 优势（3.125% vs 0.625%）\\\\n\\\\n## Claims & 实验覆盖（详见 experiment_plan.yaml）\\\\n| Claim | P0 实验 | P1 实验 | 状态 |\\\\n|-------|---------|---------|------|\\\\n| C1: CKA-aware pruning preserves reasoning | plan_001-006 (full eval, SFT→GRPO recovery, GRASPrune baseline, multi-seed) | plan_010 (25% sparsity) | ⏳ SFT recovery in progress |\\\\n| C2: F(h) predicts recoverability | — | plan_007 (scoring ablation), plan_008 (regression analysis) | 待 recovery 完成 |\\\\n| C3: Recovery method conditions pruning order | — | plan_009 (SFT-only comparison) | 待 recovery 完成 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] D013: SFT warmup recovery 双模型（Agent 执行中）→ plan_002\\\\n- [ ] SFT 完成后启动 GRPO warmup recovery → plan_003\\\\n- [ ] Full GSM8K 1319 samples eval 全模型 → plan_001\\\\n- [ ] GRASPrune 20% baseline 部署 + 剪枝 + recovery → plan_005\\\\n- [ ] Multi-seed RASP_20 验证 → plan_006\\\\n- [ ] Dream simulate 完成后审查 framing/plan → 等待回调\\\\n- [ ] 待 dream 通过：批准 P0 实验全面启动\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nwestb-23072：2× RTX PRO 6000 94G（cuda:0, cuda:1）| 约束 C001\\\\n- GPU0: D013 SFT recovery（RASP）\\\\n- GPU1: D013 SFT recovery（Standard）\\\\n- 总预算 ~528 GPU-hours (11 days × 2 GPU × 24h)，计划使用 ~200h，充足缓冲\\\\n\\\\n## 关键风险\\\\n1. SFT→GRPO 恢复可能仍然失败（sampling 分布问题未必被 SFT 修复）→ fallback: 纯 SFT 恢复 + post-prune 证据\\\\n2. GRASPrune（有 rescale compensation）可能在 post-prune accuracy 上超过 RASP → 需要看 recovery 后谁更强\\\\n3. 单模型（DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B）→ 论文 limitations 中坦诚讨论\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-14 | D014: MVP PASS — 接受 post-prune 29% vs 1% 作为充分证据，GR | grpo_rasp_20_4096, grpo_standard_20_4096, grpo_rasp_20_fast, grpo_standard_20_fast, mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4 |\\\\n| D013 | 2026-05-14 | D012: RASP GRPO 4096也零梯度, 根因是sampling下无EOS而非token长 | grpo_rasp_20_4096, grpo_standard_20_4096 |\\\\n| D012 | 2026-05-14 | D011: Kill grpo_standard_20_4096 early, start grpo | grpo_standard_20_4096, grpo_rasp_20_4096 |\\\\n| D011 | 2026-05-14 | D011: Kill standard GRPO 4096 (10步零梯度), 将GPU1转给RAS | grpo_standard_20_4096, grpo_rasp_20_4096 |\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-14 | 审批 Option A：max_completion_length=4096 重跑 GRPO 双实验 | grpo_rasp_20_fast, grpo_standard_20_fast |\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-14 | GRPO 1024-token 截断伪阴性：不接受 negative 结论，诊断性 eval + 准 | grpo_rasp_20_fast, grpo_standard_20_fast |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-14 | 正式更新 MVP 判定标准：从 per-group ρ ≥ 0.4 改为 model-level 显 | grpo_rasp_20_fast, grpo_standard_20_fast, mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4 |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-14 | Kill 270h GRPO runs，用 max_completion=1024 + 1 epoc | grpo_rasp_20, grpo_standard_20 |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-14 | 20% sparsity 下 RASP 29% vs Standard 1%，Scenario B  | mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4 |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-14 | 放弃 35% sparsity 作为 MVP 目标，改用 20%/25% 双 sparsity 快速 | mvp_rasp_pipeline_v3 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3280, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011HL67q1atiY