{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VXXAUWDmCFYYog3bLEPWVC","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-14\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| sft_standard_20 | D013 Stage 1: SFT warmup on Standard-pruned model (20%, 1% GSM8K) as negative control. Expected: SFT partially recovers format but reasoning remains limited. | — | — | — |\\\\n| sft_rasp_20 | D013 Stage 1: SFT warmup on RASP-pruned model (20%, 29% GSM8K) to restore EOS generation ability before GRPO Stage 2. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4: CKA functional overlap F(h) predicts structured pruning recoverability under RLVR. RASP scoring S(h)=I(h)×(1-F(h))^α selects structures whose removal is more recoverable via GRPO RLVR than standard importance-only pruning. V4: Dual sparsity probe (20% + 25%) to find viable operating point where pruned models retain >5% accuracy, then GRPO recovery comparison.（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **grpo_rasp_20_4096** (failed): D010: RASP-pruned model (20% sparsity, post-prune 29% GSM8K) GRPO recovery with max_completion_length=4096 (fix D009 truncation). Core MVP experiment — if recovery succeeds, RASP structure selection enables RLVR recovery that standard pruning cannot. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n- **grpo_standard_20_4096** (negative): D010: Standard-pruned model (20% sparsity, post-prune 1% GSM8K) GRPO recovery with max_completion_length=4096 (fix D009 truncation). Negative control — expected to fail recovery due to non-optimal structure selection, confirming RASP advantage. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n- **grpo_standard_20_fast** (negative): Standard-pruned model (20% sparsity, post-prune 1% GSM8K) expected to fail GRPO recovery (RewardDesertCallback triggers). This is the negative control — confirms RASP's structure selection enables recovery that standard pruning cannot. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 0 / 负向 4 / 失败 3 / 共 9\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-23072: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_standard_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20_4096: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2097, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DxE9NakQSDTxFnH2TCn5n4","session_id":"7b0567a5-9e40-4546-bac6-cc776d07ad03","uuid":"a3b3932d-5d31-418f-83ba-d0e721146647","timestamp":"2026-05-15T00:18:39.020Z"}
