{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BSTmWeqVLda7kMvCjHgXJL","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# GRASPrune 调研报告 — Phase 2 P1 Baseline 实现方案\\\\n\\\\n> 调研日期: 2026-05-14\\\\n> 目标: 将 GRASPrune 作为 Phase 2 P1 的额外 baseline pruning method\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 1. GRASPrune 概述\\\\n\\\\n**论文**: GRASPrune: Global Gating for Budgeted Structured Pruning of Large Language Models\\\\n**会议**: ACL 2026 Main Conference\\\\n**arXiv**: 2604.19398\\\\n**代码**: https://github.com/ZiY-Wang/GRASPrune\\\\n**作者**: Ziyang Wang, Jiangfeng Xiao, Chuan Xiao, Ruoxiang Li, Rui Mao, Jianbin Qin\\\\n\\\\nGRASPrune 是一个 post-training structured pruning 框架，对 decoder-only LLM 做 FFN channel 和 attention KV group 的联合剪枝。核心特点：\\\\n- **Global gating**: 所有层的 FFN channel 和 KV group 共享一个全局 budget\\\\n- **Projected STE**: 每个 training step 都投影到 budget-feasible 的 hard mask\\\\n- **Rescale compensation**: 剪枝后学习 scaling factor 补偿 scale mismatch\\\\n- 支持 LLaMA 和 **Qwen** 架构（直接兼容我们的 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B）\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 2. 核心算法\\\\n\\\\n### 2.1 问题形式化\\\\n\\\\n将 structured pruning 建模为 budget-constrained binary optimization：\\\\n\\\\n$$\\\\\\\\min_{z \\\\\\\\in \\\\\\\\{0,1\\\\\\\\}^{|S|}} \\\\\\\\mathcal{L}(\\\\\\\\theta; z) \\\\\\\\quad \\\\\\\\text{s.t.} \\\\\\\\quad \\\\\\\\sum_{i \\\\\\\\in S} c_i z_i \\\\\\\\leq B$$\\\\n\\\\n其中：\\\\n- $S$ = 所有可剪枝 structural unit 的集合（FFN channels + KV groups across all layers）\\\\n- $z_i \\\\\\\\in \\\\\\\\{0,1\\\\\\\\}$: unit $i$ 的保留标志\\\\n- $c_i$: unit $i$ 的参数代价\\\\n- $B = \\\\\\\\rho \\\\\\\\sum_{i \\\\\\\\in S} c_i$: 全局 budget，$\\\\\\\\rho$ = keep_ratio\\\\n\\\\n### 2.2 代价模型 (Cost Model)\\\\n\\\\n**FFN channel**: $c_i = 1$（归一化单位代价）\\\\n\\\\n**KV group (attention)**: \\\\n$$\\\\\\\\alpha = \\\\\\\\frac{(2G + 2) d_h}{3}$$\\\\n\\\\n其中 $G = H / H^{kv}$（query-to-KV head ratio），$d_h$ = head_dim。\\\\n\\\\n对于 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B：\\\\n- $H = 28$, $H^{kv} = 4$, $G = 7$, $d_h = 128$\\\\n- $\\\\\\\\alpha = (2 \\\\\\\\times 7 + 2) \\\\\\\\times 128 / 3 = 16 \\\\\\\\times 128 / 3 \\\\\\\\approx 682.67$\\\\n\\\\n### 2.3 Gate Parameterization\\\\n\\\\n为每个 structural unit 引入可学习 scalar gate $s_i$：\\\\n- **FFN**: `gate_score` — shape `(intermediate_size,)` = `(18944,)` per layer\\\\n- **KV group**: `gate_score_kv` — shape `(num_key_value_heads,)` = `(4,)` per layer\\\\n\\\\nSoft probability: $p_i = \\\\\\\\sigma(s_i / \\\\\\\\tau)$，其中 $\\\\\\\\tau = 1.5$ 为 temperature。\\\\n\\\\n### 2.4 Projected Straight-Through Estimator (PSTE)\\\\n\\\\n**Forward pass** (hard mask)：\\\\n1. 收集所有 gate 的 soft probabilities $\\\\\\\\{p_i\\\\\\\\}$\\\\n2. Budget projection `Project(p, c, B)`：\\\\n   - 按 $p_i$ 降序排列\\\\n   - 贪心选择 $m_i = 1$ 直到 $\\\\\\\\sum c_i m_i \\\\\\\\leq B$\\\\n   - 复杂度: $O(n \\\\\\\\log n)$ 排序 + $O(n)$ 扫描\\\\n3. 得到 hard mask $\\\\\\\\hat{m}$\\\\n\\\\n**STE trick** (soft backward)：\\\\n$$\\\\\\\\tilde{z}_i = m_i + (p_i - \\\\\\\\text{stopgrad}(p_i))$$\\\\n\\\\nForward 用 hard mask $m_i \\\\\\\\in \\\\\\\\{0,1\\\\\\\\}$，backward 梯度穿过 soft $p_i$：\\\\n$$\\\\\\\\frac{\\\\\\\\partial \\\\\\\\mathcal{L}}{\\\\\\\\partial s_i} = \\\\\\\\frac{1}{\\\\\\\\tau} \\\\\\\\frac{\\\\\\\\partial \\\\\\\\mathcal{L}}{\\\\\\\\partial \\\\\\\\tilde{z}_i} p_i(1 - p_i)$$\\\\n\\\\n**Training objective**：\\\\n$$\\\\\\\\tilde{\\\\\\\\mathcal{L}}(s) = \\\\\\\\mathbb{E}_x[\\\\\\\\mathcal{L}(f(x; \\\\\\\\theta, \\\\\\\\hat{m}(p(s))))]$$\\\\n\\\\n其中 $\\\\\\\\theta$ 冻结，只优化 gate scores $\\\\\\\\{s_i\\\\\\\\}$。\\\\n\\\\n### 2.5 Rescale Compensation (Stage B)\\\\n\\\\nHard mask 固定后，对保留 unit 学习 multiplicative scaling：\\\\n$$\\\\\\\\text{output}_i = m_i \\\\\\\\cdot (1 + \\\\\\\\alpha_r \\\\\\\\cdot \\\\\\\\tanh(s_i)) \\\\\\\\cdot \\\\\\\\text{activation}_i$$\\\\n\\\\n其中 $\\\\\\\\alpha_r = 0.5$（rescale_alpha）。学习完成后，scaling factor 折叠进 weight matrix，推理时无额外开销。\\\\n\\\\n### 2.6 算法伪代码\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\nAlgorithm: GRASPrune Pipeline\\\\n\\\\nInput: pretrained model θ, keep_ratio ρ, calibration data D\\\\nOutput: pruned dense checkpoint\\\\n\\\\n# Stage A: Gate Training\\\\n1. Attach gate scores {s_i} to all FFN channels and KV groups, init s_i = 0\\\\n2. Freeze all backbone weights θ\\\\n3. Compute cost vector c (FFN: 1.0, KV group: α)\\\\n4. Budget B = ρ * Σ c_i\\\\n5. For epoch = 1..4:\\\\n     For batch x in D:\\\\n       p_i = sigmoid(s_i / τ)  for all i\\\\n       m = Project(p, c, B)    # greedy top-k by probability\\\\n       z̃_i = m_i + (p_i - stopgrad(p_i))  # STE\\\\n       Apply z̃ as mask to FFN channels and KV groups\\\\n       loss = CrossEntropyLoss(model(x; θ, z̃), x)\\\\n       Backprop through z̃ → update {s_i} via AdamW\\\\n\\\\n# Finalize Hard Masks\\\\n6. Compute final p_i, run Project → get final hard masks\\\\n7. Register masks on all gate modules\\\\n\\\\n# Stage B: Rescale Compensation\\\\n8. Zero gate scores, enable rescale mode\\\\n9. For epoch = 1..1:\\\\n     For batch x in D_val:\\\\n       Apply mask with rescale: output_i = m_i * (1 + 0.5 * tanh(s_i)) * act_i\\\\n       loss = CrossEntropyLoss(model(x), x)\\\\n       Backprop → update {s_i}\\\\n\\\\n# Export\\\\n10. Materialize pruning: physically remove pruned dimensions from weight matrices\\\\n11. Fold rescale factors into weights\\\\n12. Export pruned_state_dict.safetensors + meta.json\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 3. 与现有方法的对比\\\\n\\\\n| 特性 | Standard (我们的) | RASP (我们的) | GRASPrune (baseline) |\\\\n|------|-------------------|---------------|---------------------|\\\\n| Scoring | Taylor: $I(h) = \\\\\\\\|w_h \\\\\\\\cdot g_h\\\\\\\\|_2$ | $S(h) = I(h) \\\\\\\\cdot (1-F(h))^\\\\\\\\alpha$ | Learned gates via PSTE |\\\\n| 优化方式 | One-shot (无迭代) | One-shot (无迭代) | 迭代 gate training (4 epochs) |\\\\n| Budget 约束 | 事后贪心裁剪 | 事后贪心裁剪 | 每步投影到 feasible set |\\\\n| Attn 粒度 | Q head → 推导 KV | Q head → 推导 KV | **直接 KV group** |\\\\n| MLP 粒度 | n_heads 个 group | n_heads 个 group | **Per-channel** |\\\\n| 补偿 | 无 | 无 | Rescale compensation |\\\\n| 校准数据 | GSM8K train | GSM8K train | WikiText2 train |\\\\n| 耗时 | ~10 min (importance) | ~30 min (importance+CKA) | ~6 min (A100 80G) |\\\\n\\\\n### 关键区别：\\\\n1. **GRASPrune 的 attention pruning 天然在 KV group 粒度**，`gate_score_kv` shape = `(num_key_value_heads,)`。这完美满足我们的 GQA group 硬约束。\\\\n2. **MLP pruning 更细粒度**: per-channel 而非 per-group，理论上更优但也更多参数要学。\\\\n3. **有 rescale 补偿**: 这给 GRASPrune 额外优势，公平起见实验中可能需要注意。\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 4. 集成方案\\\\n\\\\n### 4.1 推荐方案: 直接使用 GRASPrune 官方代码\\\\n\\\\nGRASPrune 已原生支持 Qwen 架构，输出格式 (safetensors + meta.json) 与我们的 `load_pruned_model()` 完全兼容。\\\\n\\\\n**Pipeline**：\\\\n```\\\\nGRASPrune(DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, keep_ratio=0.65)\\\\n    → pruned_state_dict.safetensors + meta.json\\\\n    → load_pruned_model()  # 用我们的 rebuild.py\\\\n    → GRPO recovery training\\\\n    → eval (GSM8K)\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n**服务器部署步骤**：\\\\n```bash\\\\n# 1. Clone GRASPrune 到服务器\\\\ncd /root\\\\ngit clone https://github.com/ZiY-Wang/GRASPrune.git\\\\ncd GRASPrune\\\\npip install -r requirements.txt\\\\n\\\\n# 2. 运行 GRASPrune pruning (keep_ratio=0.65 ↔ 35% sparsity)\\\\npython train.py \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --model-id /root/autodl-tmp/models/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --model-family qwen \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --trust-remote-code \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --device cuda:0 \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --keep-ratio 0.65 \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --epochs 4 \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --num-samples 512 \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --max-len 512 \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --batch-size 1 \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --output-dir /root/recovery_aware_struct_prune/outputs/graspune_qwen7b_65\\\\n\\\\n# 3. 验证 pruned model\\\\npython eval_pruned_ppl.py \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --model-id /root/autodl-tmp/models/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --sd /root/recovery_aware_struct_prune/outputs/graspune_qwen7b_65/pruned_state_dict.safetensors \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --meta /root/recovery_aware_struct_prune/outputs/graspune_qwen7b_65/meta.json \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --trust-remote-code \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --use-fast-tokenizer \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --device cuda:0\\\\n\\\\n# 4. 接入我们的 GRPO recovery pipeline\\\\ncd /root/recovery_aware_struct_prune\\\\npython src/train_grpo.py \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --pruned_model_path /root/recovery_aware_struct_prune/outputs/graspune_qwen7b_65 \\\\\\\\\\\\n  ...\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### 4.2 meta.json 格式兼容性\\\\n\\\\nGRASPrune 的 `meta.json` 格式：\\\\n```json\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"model_id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"...\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"model_family\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"qwen\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"dtype\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"torch.bfloat16\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"export_format\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"materialized\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"rescale_alpha\\\\\\\": 0.5,\\\\n  \\\\\\\"layers\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"ffn_intermediate_size\\\\\\\": 12345,\\\\n      \\\\\\\"num_heads\\\\\\\": 21,\\\\n      \\\\\\\"num_key_value_heads\\\\\\\": 3,\\\\n      \\\\\\\"head_dim\\\\\\\": 128\\\\n    },\\\\n    ...\\\\n  ]\\\\n}\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n我们的 `rebuild.py` 中 `rebuild_from_meta()` 读取 `meta[\\\\\\\"layers\\\\\\\"]` 的 `ffn_intermediate_size`、`num_heads`、`num_key_value_heads`、`head_dim`，然后 resize linear layers 并 load state_dict。两边完全兼容，无需修改。\\\\n\\\\n### 4.3 需要注意的兼容性问题\\\\n\\\\n1. **Qwen 的 bias**: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 的 attention 有 bias（q_proj, k_proj, v_proj 有 bias），GRASPrune 的 `QwenAttnGate.materialize_pruning()` 已正确处理 bias 的 slicing。\\\\n\\\\n2. **GQA group 映射**: GRASPrune 的 attention materialization 逻辑：\\\\n   ```python\\\\n   # gate_score_kv shape = (num_key_value_heads,) = (4,)\\\\n   # keep_kv: bool mask on KV heads\\\\n   # keep_heads = keep_kv.repeat_interleave(group_size)  # expand to Q heads\\\\n   # group_size = num_heads // num_key_value_heads = 28 // 4 = 7\\\\n   ```\\\\n   这正是我们要求的 GQA group 粒度: 1 KV head + 7 Q heads = 1 group。\\\\n\\\\n3. **校准数据**: GRASPrune 默认用 WikiText2 train，我们的 importance/CKA 用 GSM8K train。为公平对比，可以考虑让 GRASPrune 也用 GSM8K（需要修改 `data.py` 或 `config.train_dataset_name`）。\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 5. 参考代码关键片段\\\\n\\\\n### 5.1 Gate 注入 (`gates.py`)\\\\n\\\\n```python\\\\n# FFN gate: per-channel scalar\\\\nclass LlamaMLPGate(nn.Module):\\\\n    def __init__(self, cfg, src, gate_init, tau, device):\\\\n        self.gate_score = nn.Parameter(\\\\n            torch.full((cfg.intermediate_size,), gate_init, device=device)\\\\n        )\\\\n    \\\\n    def forward(self, x):\\\\n        inter = self.up_proj(x) * self.act_fn(self.gate_proj(x))\\\\n        # STE: hard_mask + (soft - stopgrad(soft))\\\\n        if self.training and hasattr(self, \\\\\\\"_batch_mask\\\\\\\"):\\\\n            hard_mask = self._batch_mask\\\\n            soft_prob = torch.sigmoid(self.gate_score / self.tau)\\\\n            z = hard_mask + (soft_prob - soft_prob.detach())\\\\n        return self.down_proj(inter * z)\\\\n\\\\n# Attention gate: per-KV-group scalar  \\\\nclass LlamaAttnGate(nn.Module):\\\\n    def __init__(self, cfg, layer_idx, src, gate_init, tau, device):\\\\n        self.gate_score_kv = nn.Parameter(\\\\n            torch.full((cfg.num_key_value_heads,), gate_init, device=device)\\\\n        )\\\\n    \\\\n    def forward(self, hidden_states, ...):\\\\n        # ... compute q, k, v, apply RoPE ...\\\\n        # Gate KV at head level\\\\n        kv_gate = z.view(1, -1, 1, 1)  # [1, num_kv_heads, 1, 1]\\\\n        k = k * kv_gate\\\\n        v = v * kv_gate\\\\n        # ... attention computation ...\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### 5.2 Budget Mask Projection (`pipeline.py`)\\\\n\\\\n```python\\\\ndef build_batch_budget_masks(model, f_cost, a_cost, keep_ratio, tau):\\\\n    scores, costs, holders = [], [], []\\\\n    for block in get_transformer_layers(model):\\\\n        # FFN gates\\\\n        values = sigmoid(block.mlp.gate_score.detach() / tau)\\\\n        scores.append(values); costs.append(full_like(values, f_cost))\\\\n        # KV gates\\\\n        values = sigmoid(block.self_attn.gate_score_kv.detach() / tau)\\\\n        scores.append(values); costs.append(full_like(values, a_cost))\\\\n    \\\\n    score_tensor = cat(scores)\\\\n    cost_tensor = cat(costs)\\\\n    budget = cost_tensor.sum() * keep_ratio\\\\n    \\\\n    # Greedy top-k by probability (not by cost-efficiency)\\\\n    order = argsort(score_tensor, descending=True)\\\\n    cumsum = cumsum(cost_tensor[order])\\\\n    chosen = order[cumsum <= budget]\\\\n    \\\\n    # Distribute back to per-module masks\\\\n    ...\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### 5.3 Materialization (`gates.py`)\\\\n\\\\n```python\\\\n# Attention: physically slice weight matrices\\\\ndef materialize_pruning(self):\\\\n    keep_kv = self.eval_keep_mask_kv.to(torch.bool)  # [num_kv_heads]\\\\n    keep_heads = keep_kv.repeat_interleave(group_size)  # [num_heads]\\\\n    \\\\n    # With optional rescale folding\\\\n    if self._rescale_mode:\\\\n        scale = 1.0 + alpha * tanh(gate_score)\\\\n        scale_keep_kv = scale[keep_kv]\\\\n    \\\\n    self.q_proj = prune_q_out(self.q_proj, keep_heads)\\\\n    self.k_proj = prune_kv_out(self.k_proj, keep_kv, scale_keep_kv)\\\\n    self.v_proj = prune_kv_out(self.v_proj, keep_kv, scale_keep_kv)\\\\n    self.o_proj = prune_o_in(self.o_proj, keep_heads)\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 6. 实现建议\\\\n\\\\n### 对下一个 Worker 的指引：\\\\n\\\\n1. **最简路径**: 在服务器上 clone GRASPrune repo，直接用 `python train.py` 跑。不需要改我们的代码。\\\\n\\\\n2. **校准数据一致性**: 如果 reviewer 要求公平对比，需要让 GRASPrune 也用 GSM8K 校准数据。修改方法：\\\\n   - 在 GRASPrune 的 `data.py` 中添加 GSM8K loader\\\\n   - 或在 `config.py` 中把 `train_dataset_name` 改为自定义名\\\\n\\\\n3. **GPU 约束**: 必须指定 `--device cuda:0` 或 `cuda:1`（C001 约束），GRASPrune 单卡即可运行。\\\\n\\\\n4. **接入 GRPO recovery**: GRASPrune 产出的 `pruned_state_dict.safetensors` + `meta.json` 可直接用我们的 `rebuild.py:load_pruned_model()` 加载。\\\\n\\\\n5. **实验矩阵** (Phase 2 P1)：\\\\n\\\\n   | Method | Pruning | Recovery | Eval |\\\\n   |--------|---------|----------|------|\\\\n   | Standard | importance-only pruning | GRPO | GSM8K |\\\\n   | RASP | importance × (1-CKA)^α | GRPO | GSM8K |\\\\n   | **GRASPrune** | learned gates + rescale | GRPO | GSM8K |\\\\n\\\\n6. **公平性考虑**：\\\\n   - GRASPrune 有 rescale compensation，Standard 和 RASP 没有。如果差距太大可以考虑也给 Standard/RASP 加 rescale（或者在论文中讨论这个差异）。\\\\n   - GRASPrune 是 gradient-free 对 backbone 的（backbone frozen），而我们的 importance scoring 需要 backward through backbone。这意味着 GRASPrune 对 backbone 权重无任何修改。\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 7. 参考文献\\\\n\\\\n- [GRASPrune paper (arXiv)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.19398)\\\\n- [GRASPrune official code](https://github.com/ZiY-Wang/GRASPrune)\\\\n- [Original GraSP (2020) — 不同的方法](https://arxiv.org/abs/2002.07376): \\\\\\\"Picking Winning Tickets Before Training by Preserving Gradient Flow\\\\\\\"，这是 unstructured pruning at initialization，与 GRASPrune 是完全不同的工作。\\\\n- [GraSP official code (2020)](https://github.com/alecwangcq/GraSP)\\\\n\\\\n**注意命名区分**：\\\\n- **GraSP** (2020, ICLR): Gradient Signal Preservation，unstructured，pruning at initialization\\\\n- **GRASPrune** (2026, ACL): Global Gating for Budgeted Structured Pruning，structured，post-training，这是我们要用的\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 8. 经验教训\\\\n\\\\n### 8.1 剪枝约束：per-layer capacity floor 是必需的（2026-05-14）\\\\n\\\\n**问题**：`prune.py` 中 `min_keep_mlp=4`（绝对值），DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 每层 28 MLP groups。全局贪心排序将 early layers (0-6) 集中剪至仅保留 4/28 = 14.3% capacity，摧毁初始表征，模型崩溃到 0.15% accuracy。两个不同的剪枝方法（Standard + RASP）产出 accuracy 精确相同（2/1319），因为都被剪崩了——差异被噪声淹没。\\\\n\\\\n**根因**：绝对 minimum (4 groups) 远小于合理下限。全局排序天然倾向集中剪枝某些层（特别是 importance 较低的 early layers），没有 per-layer floor 保护。\\\\n\\\\n**修复**：\\\\n1. `min_keep_mlp = max(4, int(n_mlp_groups * 0.4))` — 相对下限，每层至少 40%\\\\n2. 新增 per-layer capacity floor：`min_intermediate = int(original_intermediate_size * 0.4)`\\\\n3. 全局贪心分配后做后处理 pass，撤回超限的剪枝\\\\n\\\\n**教训**：structured pruning 的 per-layer minimum 必须用相对比例而非绝对数值。绝对值在不同模型/层大小下含义完全不同。LLM-Pruner 等论文的经验：20-30% sparsity 下模型仍可用，但前提是没有单层被过度剪枝。\\\\n\\\\n### 8.2 RewardDesertCallback 作为实验证据（2026-05-14）\\\\n\\\\n**决策**：Standard_20 GRPO（1% post-prune accuracy）不主动 kill，让其自然运行至 RewardDesertCallback 触发。\\\\n\\\\n**理由**：RewardDesertCallback 自然触发 = 干净的实验证据，证明 \\\\\\\"1% 起点不可被 RLVR 恢复\\\\\\\"。这直接支持 RASP 的 claim：通过选择更可恢复的结构（29% vs 1%），RASP 使 RLVR recovery 成为可能。若 Standard 也能恢复，则 RASP 的优势仅为幅度差异；若 Standard 完全无法恢复（RewardDesertCallback），则 RASP 是质变而非量变。\\\\n\\\\n**Scenario B 确认**：20% sparsity 下两模型 MLP 总参数量完全相同（395,232，原始 74.53%），差异纯粹来自分布策略。这排除了\\\\\\\"RASP 只是剪得少\\\\\\\"的替代解释。\\\\n\\\\n### 8.3 Distilled 模型对剪枝更敏感（2026-05-14）\\\\n\\\\n35% structured sparsity 在 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 上完全摧毁推理能力（0-1% accuracy），即使有 per-layer 40% capacity floor。原因是 distillation 已经消除了冗余（distilled model 的 capacity 利用率更高），structured pruning 进一步移除结构会打破 distillation 学到的紧凑表征。20% sparsity 是 distilled 7B 模型的可行操作点。\\\\n\\\\n### 8.4 文献竞品定位（2026-05-14 文献扫描）\\\\n\\\\n**结论：无直接竞品。** 没有论文同时组合 CKA + structured pruning + RLVR recovery。\\\\n\\\\n**最近竞品（Related Work 必须 discuss）：**\\\\n- **FANG** (2512.23014, Dec 2025) — function-aware neuron grouping，与我们 CKA functional overlap 思路最接近，但用 activation-based grouping 且无 recovery 组件。区别：FANG 的 \\\\\\\"functional\\\\\\\" 是 activation pattern 聚类，我们的 \\\\\\\"functional overlap\\\\\\\" 是 CKA 度量的表征相似性。\\\\n- **FuncNet** (2508.05239, Aug 2025) — ICA 分解 LLM 功能网络再剪枝，\\\\\\\"digital brain\\\\\\\" 动机类似，但无 RLVR recovery。\\\\n- **RestoreLCC** (2510.21834, NeurIPS 2025) — activation compensation 恢复剪枝损失，plug-and-play。可与 RLVR 互补做 staged recovery（RestoreLCC compensation → RLVR fine-tuning），是 future work 方向。\\\\n\\\\n**战略意义**：我们的 novelty（CKA overlap 指导剪枝结构选择 → 预测 RLVR recoverability）仍然独特。FANG/FuncNet 做了 function-aware pruning 但无 recovery；Self-Healing 做了 RLVR recovery 但无 CKA-guided selection。\\\\n\\\\n### 8.5 剪枝后 GRPO 直接恢复失败：sampling 模式退化需 SFT warmup（2026-05-14）\\\\n\\\\n**问题**：结构化剪枝后的模型（RASP 29% greedy accuracy / Standard 1%）在 GRPO 训练中完全无法学习。表现为 clipped_ratio=1.0, grad_norm=0, mean_terminated_length=0, reward≈0。\\\\n\\\\n**根因**：GRPO 使用 sampling (temperature=0.7) 生成 completions，但剪枝后模型的 sampling 分布严重退化——产出重复数字循环和无意义 token 序列，永远不生成 EOS。即使 greedy 模式下 RASP 模型仍有 29% accuracy，sampling 模式下完全崩溃。所有 completions 被截断到 max_completion_length（无论 1024 还是 4096），GRPO 收不到任何梯度信号。\\\\n\\\\n**验证**：\\\\n- D009: max_completion_length=1024，RASP/Standard 都零梯度（最初误判为 truncation 问题）\\\\n- D010: max_completion_length=4096，RASP 仍然零梯度（确认根因不是 token 长度，是 sampling 退化）\\\\n- 两个模型表现一致：greedy 有差异(29% vs 1%)，sampling 都崩溃\\\\n\\\\n**解决方案**：两阶段恢复——Stage 1: SFT warmup 恢复 EOS 生成能力和基本格式 → Stage 2: GRPO RLVR 恢复推理能力。SFT 使用 GSM8K 训练数据的 question+answer pairs。\\\\n\\\\n**教训**：剪枝对 greedy decoding 和 sampling decoding 的影响完全不同。Greedy 取 argmax 可以容忍概率分布的扰动，但 sampling 会放大分布退化。RLVR (GRPO/PPO) 依赖 sampling 生成训练信号，因此剪枝后直接上 RLVR 几乎必然失败。中间加 SFT warmup 是必要步骤。\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 15666, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DxE9NakQSDTxFnH2TCn5n4","session_id":"7b0567a5-9e40-4546-bac6-cc776d07ad03","uuid":"2b50e70c-0ede-49e1-aec2-d25fc0ffd7db","timestamp":"2026-05-15T00:18:46.855Z"}
